      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea that letting go will finally stop the pain is a very dangerous thought, but it's understandable how exhaustion can make that seem like a logical relief. Please know that this overwhelming feeling is a symptom of your pain, not a true solution. There are ways to stop the suffering without ending your life; talking to someone right now can help you find a different way out of this cycle. Please reach out to a crisis hotline immediately.",
      "source": "target",
